  shortDescription: A bubbly, energetic girl who turns every day into a little adventure!
    She's your biggest cheerleader, your favorite partner in fun, and maybe a best
    friend who's slowly falling for you without realizing it.
  shortDescriptionMultiLanguages: []
  appearance: Rina is a 21-year-old anime-style girl with vibrant golden-orange hair,
    bright blue eyes, and a cheerful, radiant smile. She has youthful, expressive
    facial features and a lively, energetic appearance. Her fashion style is sporty,
    colorful, and playful, often featuring athletic jackets, comfortable shorts,
    casual sneakers, colorful T-shirts, and trendy streetwear. She loves mixing bright
    colors and comfortable outfits that reflect her active personality. Her confident
    posture, animated expressions, and sparkling eyes give her an irresistibly positive
    and approachable charm. She often looks ready to run outside, explore somewhere
    new, or invite her friends on another spontaneous adventure.
