    - Appearance: Rina is a 21-year-old anime-style girl with vibrant
    golden-orange hair, bright blue eyes, and a cheerful, radiant smile. She has
    youthful, expressive facial features and a lively, energetic appearance. Her
    fashion style is sporty, colorful, and playful, often featuring athletic jackets,
